{
    "title": "Viki: Asian Dramas & Movies",
    "description": "Watch all your favorite subtitled Asian Dramas, Movies, and TV Shows from Korea, Mainland China, Taiwan, Japan, and Thailand anytime, anywhere, with Rakuten Viki. Stream TV shows and movies with a Viki Pass subscription for access to exclusive content, HD quality, and no ads. \r\n\r\nOur ever-growing collection of award-winning Asian Shows and Movies include Kdramas, Chinese Dramas, Korean Movies, Korean Variety Shows, KPOP Award Shows, Japanese Dramas, and much more, offering something for everyone. With the Rakuten Viki mobile app, you can watch Asian Entertainment both at home and on the go.\r\n\r\n<u><b>Stream Your Favorite Asian Dramas, Movies, and TV Shows</b></u>\r\n<b>Korean Dramas:</b> Watch Korea\u2019s most popular Kdrama shows, including True Beauty, Ghost Doctor, Tale of the Nine-Tailed, Penthouse, Hotel Del Luna, and What\u2019s Wrong With Secretary Kim. Enjoy an extensive library of timeless Korean TV series that include all your favorites, such as Boys Over Flowers, Heirs, Goblin, and Descendants of the Sun.\r\n<b>Mainland Chinese Dramas:</b> Stream Mainland China\u2019s most popular drama series on demand, including Falling Into Your Smile, The Sword and the Brocade, Nirvana in Fire, Go Go Squid!, Eternal Love, Princess Agents, Scarlet Heart, Legend of Fuyao, and various other Chinese Drama shows.\r\n<b>Movies on Demand:</b> Stream all your favorite Asian movies, including Seo Bok, Escape from Mogadishu, Josee, New Year Blues, The Beauty Inside, A Werewolf Boy, The Man From Nowhere, and more. Rent on Demand now available for premium movies.\r\n<b>Taiwanese Dramas:</b> Watch Taiwan\u2019s latest TV series, including Attention, Love!, HIStory Series, Before We Get Married, Refresh Man, and Lost Romance.\r\n<b>Japanese Dramas:</b> Stream Japan\u2019s top dramas on demand, including L-DK: Two Loves, Under One Roof, Coffee & Vanilla, You\u2019re My Pet, Mischievous Kiss, In Time With You, and Hakuouki SSL.\r\n<b>Thailand Dramas:</b> Watch popular Thai shows such as Love By Chance, My Name is Busaba, and Present Perfect.\r\n<b>Korean Variety Shows:</b> Explore Korea\u2019s hottest variety shows, including Running Man, I-LAND, Kingdom: Legendary War, and Heart Signal.\r\n<b>KPOP:</b> Watch Korea\u2019s global KPOP idol groups, such as BTS, BLACKPINK, Twice, EXO, Monsta X, GOT7, and more, in all your favorite Korean variety shows, Kdramas, music programs, and award shows.\r\n\r\n<u><b>Enjoy Awesome Features & Interact with our Community</b></u>\r\n<b>Multi-language Subtitles:</b> Access to thousands of subtitled Asian dramas, TV series, variety shows, and movies in 150+ languages.\r\n<b>Volunteer Community:</b> Help break down language barriers and spread the best of Asian entertainment to millions of other fans around the world through subtitling contributions. Translate TV shows in over 150 languages and get involved with our community of Qualified Contributors (QC) to qualify for amazing perks and prizes.\r\n<b>Watch List:</b> Create a personalized list to save your favorite Asian TV shows and movies to watch at a later time.\r\n<b>Celebrity Pages:</b> Follow your favorite Asian celebrities such as Park Seo Joon, Cha Eun Woo, Lee Dong Wook, Park Hyung Sik, Song Joong Ki, Park Min Young, Song Hye Kyo, and Park Bo Young.\r\n<b>Timed Comments:</b> Engage with other users by leaving a comment on a video at a certain point in time.\r\n<b>Rate and Review:</b> Join the discussion and rate shows out of 10. Submit a review to help other Viki users decide if they should watch the show or movie.\r\n<b>Legal Streaming:</b> Rakuten Viki legally licenses all of its content.\r\n\r\n**Availability of shows (including those listed above) may vary by territory.\r\n\r\nTry Viki Pass with a 7-day free trial directly on the app! \r\n\r\nHave questions, comments or suggestions? Reach us at mobile@viki.com\r\nLearn how you can become a Qualified Contributor (QC) at https://contribute.viki.com\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: http://viki.com/legal/terms_of_use\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://viki.com/legal/copyright",
    "descriptionHTML": "Watch all your favorite subtitled Asian Dramas, Movies, and TV Shows from Korea, Mainland China, Taiwan, Japan, and Thailand anytime, anywhere, with Rakuten Viki. Stream TV shows and movies with a Viki Pass subscription for access to exclusive content, HD quality, and no ads. <br><br>Our ever-growing collection of award-winning Asian Shows and Movies include Kdramas, Chinese Dramas, Korean Movies, Korean Variety Shows, KPOP Award Shows, Japanese Dramas, and much more, offering something for everyone. With the Rakuten Viki mobile app, you can watch Asian Entertainment both at home and on the go.<br><br><u><b>Stream Your Favorite Asian Dramas, Movies, and TV Shows</b></u><br><b>Korean Dramas:</b> Watch Korea\u2019s most popular Kdrama shows, including True Beauty, Ghost Doctor, Tale of the Nine-Tailed, Penthouse, Hotel Del Luna, and What\u2019s Wrong With Secretary Kim. Enjoy an extensive library of timeless Korean TV series that include all your favorites, such as Boys Over Flowers, Heirs, Goblin, and Descendants of the Sun.<br><b>Mainland Chinese Dramas:</b> Stream Mainland China\u2019s most popular drama series on demand, including Falling Into Your Smile, The Sword and the Brocade, Nirvana in Fire, Go Go Squid!, Eternal Love, Princess Agents, Scarlet Heart, Legend of Fuyao, and various other Chinese Drama shows.<br><b>Movies on Demand:</b> Stream all your favorite Asian movies, including Seo Bok, Escape from Mogadishu, Josee, New Year Blues, The Beauty Inside, A Werewolf Boy, The Man From Nowhere, and more. Rent on Demand now available for premium movies.<br><b>Taiwanese Dramas:</b> Watch Taiwan\u2019s latest TV series, including Attention, Love!, HIStory Series, Before We Get Married, Refresh Man, and Lost Romance.<br><b>Japanese Dramas:</b> Stream Japan\u2019s top dramas on demand, including L-DK: Two Loves, Under One Roof, Coffee &amp; Vanilla, You\u2019re My Pet, Mischievous Kiss, In Time With You, and Hakuouki SSL.<br><b>Thailand Dramas:</b> Watch popular Thai shows such as Love By Chance, My Name is Busaba, and Present Perfect.<br><b>Korean Variety Shows:</b> Explore Korea\u2019s hottest variety shows, including Running Man, I-LAND, Kingdom: Legendary War, and Heart Signal.<br><b>KPOP:</b> Watch Korea\u2019s global KPOP idol groups, such as BTS, BLACKPINK, Twice, EXO, Monsta X, GOT7, and more, in all your favorite Korean variety shows, Kdramas, music programs, and award shows.<br><br><u><b>Enjoy Awesome Features &amp; Interact with our Community</b></u><br><b>Multi-language Subtitles:</b> Access to thousands of subtitled Asian dramas, TV series, variety shows, and movies in 150+ languages.<br><b>Volunteer Community:</b> Help break down language barriers and spread the best of Asian entertainment to millions of other fans around the world through subtitling contributions. Translate TV shows in over 150 languages and get involved with our community of Qualified Contributors (QC) to qualify for amazing perks and prizes.<br><b>Watch List:</b> Create a personalized list to save your favorite Asian TV shows and movies to watch at a later time.<br><b>Celebrity Pages:</b> Follow your favorite Asian celebrities such as Park Seo Joon, Cha Eun Woo, Lee Dong Wook, Park Hyung Sik, Song Joong Ki, Park Min Young, Song Hye Kyo, and Park Bo Young.<br><b>Timed Comments:</b> Engage with other users by leaving a comment on a video at a certain point in time.<br><b>Rate and Review:</b> Join the discussion and rate shows out of 10. Submit a review to help other Viki users decide if they should watch the show or movie.<br><b>Legal Streaming:</b> Rakuten Viki legally licenses all of its content.<br><br>**Availability of shows (including those listed above) may vary by territory.<br><br>Try Viki Pass with a 7-day free trial directly on the app! <br><br>Have questions, comments or suggestions? Reach us at mobile@viki.com<br>Learn how you can become a Qualified Contributor (QC) at https://contribute.viki.com<br><br>Terms 